text: |-
  Tyler Bowyer V
  @tyle... 12/5/25
  Do you know how many times we
  discussed the threats that were out
  there? I probably have seen hundreds of
  significant threats and we regularly
  discussed the belief that the deep state
  and radical regimes were after him.
  l've been asked zero questions directly
  by anyone.
  I have seen plenty of people make a
  whole lot of stuff up for clicks. That's
  been interesting. Hence why I am thrilled
  for anyone to come down to our HQ and
  talk to us.
